    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A list model of the deltas not uploaded to QFieldCloud yet, one row per changed feature, sorted so that the rows of a layer are adjacent and a view can section them by LayerId. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
    <inheritancegraph>
